OL,3,GNEWSAGraeme Dott removed from snooker
OL,4,AHall of Fame after child abuse
OL,5,Aconviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FGraeme Dott has been removed from World
OL,8,FSnooker's Hall of Fame after he was
OL,9,Fconvicted of sexually abusing two
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FThe 49-year-old, who won the title in
OL,13,F2006, was found guilty on Monday of two
OL,14,Fcounts of lewd, indecent and libidinous
OL,15,Fbehaviour towards a girl and a boy
OL,16,Fbetween 1993 and 2010.
OL,18,FA five-day trial heard Dott had exposed
OL,19,Fhimself and inappropriately touched a
OL,20,Fprimary school girl in the 1990s and
OL,21,Fattacked a young boy between 2006 and
OL,22,F2010. He will be sentenced next month.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
