OL,3,GNEWSAGraeme Dott removed from snooker
OL,4,AHall of Fame after child abuse
OL,5,Aconviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FWorld Snooker has now confirmed Dott
OL,8,Fwill be removed from the list of
OL,9,Fplayers considered to have made an
OL,10,Foutstanding contribution to the sport
OL,11,F"with immediate effect".
